abstract: >-
  A simulation data platform and benchmark for generalizable dexterous
  manipulation, built on NVIDIA Isaac Sim 5.1 with a ROKAE-Wuji bimanual
  platform. It provides 66 tasks with 18,000 curated demonstrations.
